# ============================================================================
# ARRIVAL IN INABA, THEN THE FIRST PLAYER CONTROL (authored 2026-09-28 in a resident `session`).
# The movie hands over at ~f17700: Dojima at the station ("Hey! Over here!"), the car ride
# and the gas station. Every line there is advanced with a CROSS every 44 frames - the
# presses below are exactly the ones that session made. By f23584 the title is in FIELD
# MODE on "Shopping District, South": no dialogue box, the location banner up, and a cross
# does nothing (the session held there for 8,000 frames of crosses with no change).
# The left stick then WALKS the protagonist and the camera follows - that is gameplay.
# ============================================================================
